air above her between her face and the lens.\n\nTRANSITION: a sudden LOUD CRACK of an old brass ice-cream-cart bell off-screen, the sound WHIPPING the floating words sideways and SMEARING them like wet ink across the frame, motion-streaked —\n\nCUT 2: low hero angle on 小叶子, the blue-haired girl in her frilly white bikini and oversized sun hat, bursting through the gothic stone archway of the manor courtyard like a one-girl parade — a double-scoop strawberry-vanilla cone in one hand, a black-sesame cone in the other, blue hair and white ribbons fluttering in the breeze, her eyes sparkling with mischief, freckles catching the noon light, shouting her line: \"特莉波卡——你的草莓圣代——三分钟之内不出现就归我啦——!!\" — comic-style speed-lines and ink splatter bursting from the doorway, sun-flecks scattered across the frame like halftone dots, drips of melting ice cream flying off the cones in slow-motion arcs, a tiny silver sigil on her hatband flashing once. She leans INTO the camera as she taunts. Hold on her triumphant grin.\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1480, 6000], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [286, 287], "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [315, 90], "pos": [-67.81510925292969, 4670.5205078125], "widgets_values": ["SexGod-NaughtyTime-v1-s-lora-MINIMAXH3.safetensors", 0], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 289, "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "stre